althy on v5.1.0 with an 18% error rate. I tried to roll it back to v5.0.0, but the approver denied it and said the problem is in `payments-worker`.\n- **Rollback:** payments-worker v3.4.0 is marked unhealthy, with an 18% error rate. I rolled it back to v3.3.0, its most recent release that was healthy in production. The approver signed off, and us-east, us-west and eu-west are all now on v3.3.0.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as SEV2 for payments-worker.\n\npayments-api is still on v5.1.0 and was showing errors before the rollback. I haven't re-checked it since. Please check whether it has recovered now that payments-worker is rolled back. I've noted this in the incident.", "type": "text"}]}]}